---Arguments from command-line---
   1  arg: u-235
   2  arg: -ylog
   3  arg: -xlog
   4  arg: -annot:0.01,6,<b>Eta(MT18)</b>
   ---str2annot:[0.01,6,<b>Eta(MT18)</b>] --> ('<b>Eta(MT18)</b>', 0.01, 6.0)

---Parameters:
   target:  u-235
   x4react: n,abs;n,non
   e4react: n,nu_tot
   x4quant: ,eta
   Output:  U235-eta
   x-axis:  log     range: None
   y-axis:  log     range: None

---Retrieve EXFOR data from SQL database---
___getConnSQLite: file:../../x4sqlite1.db?mode=rw
Connected to: [sqlite3]
---getX4SqlSearch_NUBAR: u-235 n,abs;n,non ,eta  and sf8='' 
SQL:
select *                                  
 ,y  as YY, dy  as dYY                    
 ,x1 as En, dx1 as dEn                    
from uni1                                 
where                                     
 Target like 'u-235'                 
 and (  (Reaction like 'n,abs') or (Reaction like 'n,non') ) 
 and SF58 like ',eta'                 
 and x2 is null                           
 and sf8=''  
order by fullCode,YearRef1 desc,DatasetID 
 ,En,iPoint                               


